/* 兑换弹窗：布局全部按贴图 929×294 的百分比定位，面板宽度锁定则高度固定不错位 */
.rdm-root {
  position: fixed;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  z-index: 130;
}

.rdm-backdrop {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

/* 面板宽 76% (= 570rpx)，高 = 570 × 294/929 ≈ 180rpx；显式定高防图片未加载时塌陷 */
.rdm-panel {
  position: relative;
  width: 76%;
}

.rdm-panel-bg {
  width: 100%;
  display: block;
  height: 180rpx;
}

/* 输入槽位：x 52/929 ≈ 5.6% 起、宽 825/929 ≈ 88.8%；y 86/294 ≈ 29.3% 起 */
.rdm-input-slot {
  position: absolute;
  left: 5.6%;
  top: 26%;
  width: 88.8%;
}

.rdm-input-bg {
  width: 100%;
  display: block;
  height: 49rpx;
}

/* input 叠在输入框贴图上，垂直居中 */
.rdm-input {
  position: absolute;
  left: 4%;
  top: 50%;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  width: 92%;
  height: 100%;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: #4a3728;
  text-align: center;
}

.rdm-error {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  top: 58%;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #d05555;
}

/* 确认键 171×76，宽 22% (= 125rpx)，高 = 125 × 76/171 ≈ 56rpx */
.rdm-confirm {
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  top: 60%;
  width: 22%;
  height: 56rpx;
}

.rdm-confirm--disabled {
  opacity: 0.6;
}

.rdm-close {
  position: absolute;
  top: -24rpx;
  right: -16rpx;
  width: 48rpx;
  height: 48rpx;
}
